# Docker build context = repo root for every service Dockerfile
# (packages/omnimind-api, packages/boardroom-ai, packages/omnimind-mcp).
# Keep local artefacts out so a fresh `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` and
# `tsc` inside the image are never overlaid by host node_modules / dist.
#
# Deliberately NOT excluded (the images need them): docs/prompts (runtime
# persona prompts), scripts/check-prompts-integrity.sh, pnpm-lock.yaml,
# every package.json / pnpm-workspace.yaml / turbo.json / tsconfig*.json,
# and packages/*/prisma (schema + migrations).
node_modules
**/node_modules
.git
**/dist
research_notes
reports
coverage
*.log
